          "description": "Follow a day in the life of prehistoric animals with Tales of Extinction. Listen as they fight to survive in a prehistoric world that time forgot.Soundscape Story TellingHuman Narration & WritingExtinct Animal factsQuiz to Assist LearningTales of Extinction sets out to capture the thrill of following ancient animals through the perils of prehistoric life. This series teaches children about extinct life while engaging their imagination.",
